          <aside class="aeo-answer">
            Home remodeling in Media, PA in 2026 centers on five project types — kitchens, bathrooms, basement finishing, additions, and exterior work — shaped by the borough's older housing stock (pre-1960 wiring, plaster walls, fieldstone foundations, narrow lots). Kitchen remodels run $25,000-$70,000+, bathrooms $15,000-$35,000, and basement finishing $20,000-$50,000+ depending on waterproofing needs. ProBrothers is a Media-based general contractor serving all of Delaware County and the Main Line.
          </aside>

          <div class="post-body" itemprop="articleBody">

            <div class="post-toc reveal" id="postToc" aria-label="Table of contents">
              <h3 class="post-toc__title">Table of Contents</h3>
              <nav class="post-toc__nav" aria-label="Article sections">
